    "name": "MAELSTROM LEGACY: The Tesla Mystery",
    "steam_appid": 2016820,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2016820/extras/11c8b525c043221880235fed550816f9.avif?t=1741698655\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>Maelstr\u00f6m Legacy: The Tesla Mystery</i> is a point-and-click puzzle adventure game for PC and Mac. Set in an anachronistic Paris, you lead the investigation when Nikola Tesla, President of the High Scientific Council and organizer of the Scientific Congress, mysteriously vanishes! Dive into an Art Nouveau and steampunk-inspired world, where vibrant characters and endless challenges await.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2016820/extras/2727343d65ff774eb4f8c392619cf901.avif?t=1741698655\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Hayao Maelstr\u00f6m, a young Japanese scientist and inventor, arrived in France two years ago and now resides in the quaint village of Valfutaie in Haute-Savoie. One day, he receives an official letter signed by Tesla himself, inviting him to the decennial Scientific Congress in Paris, held at the Eiffel Tower.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">However, just as Tesla concludes his opening speech, the lights suddenly go out. When they return, Tesla has disappeared without a trace!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">While the police launch their investigation, Hayao and his loyal dog, Alpina, set out to uncover the truth behind Tesla's disappearance.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">As Hayao and Alpina, you\u2019ll encounter an eclectic cast of intriguing characters\u2014and perhaps make a few enemies along the way!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2016820/extras/46f0bbad651d5edeaa9fbeaa3c3f6fe2.avif?t=1741698655\" /></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2016820/extras/6242d9c9ba9d4603b5828bb51d9144ec.avif?t=1741698655\" /></div><strong>Investigate</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Interact with elements in the environment to uncover valuable clues and information.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2016820/extras/5e52f7c7a8b67fa30748774597e2c246.poster.avif?t=1741698655\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2016820/extras/5e52f7c7a8b67fa30748774597e2c246.webm?t=1741698655\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2016820/extras/5e52f7c7a8b67fa30748774597e2c246.mp4?t=1741698655\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Solve Puzzles</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Find the solutions to intricate puzzles that block your path!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2016820/extras/e2dc6ffc073b61a08ed154fd298497c7.poster.avif?t=1741698655\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2016820/extras/e2dc6ffc073b61a08ed154fd298497c7.webm?t=1741698655\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2016820/extras/e2dc6ffc073b61a08ed154fd298497c7.mp4?t=1741698655\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Logic Battles</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Some characters may try to hide the truth... You\u2019ll have to overcome their \u201cLogic Shields\u201d to reveal it!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2016820/extras/92d58f1a2a570a7c4509d5f99422741f.poster.avif?t=1741698655\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2016820/extras/92d58f1a2a570a7c4509d5f99422741f.webm?t=1741698655\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2016820/extras/92d58f1a2a570a7c4509d5f99422741f.mp4?t=1741698655\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2016820/extras/11c8b525c043221880235fed550816f9.avif?t=1741698655\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>Maelstr\u00f6m Legacy: The Tesla Mystery</i> is a point-and-click puzzle adventure game for PC and Mac. Set in an anachronistic Paris, you lead the investigation when Nikola Tesla, President of the High Scientific Council and organizer of the Scientific Congress, mysteriously vanishes! Dive into an Art Nouveau and steampunk-inspired world, where vibrant characters and endless challenges await.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2016820/extras/2727343d65ff774eb4f8c392619cf901.avif?t=1741698655\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Hayao Maelstr\u00f6m, a young Japanese scientist and inventor, arrived in France two years ago and now resides in the quaint village of Valfutaie in Haute-Savoie. One day, he receives an official letter signed by Tesla himself, inviting him to the decennial Scientific Congress in Paris, held at the Eiffel Tower.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">However, just as Tesla concludes his opening speech, the lights suddenly go out. When they return, Tesla has disappeared without a trace!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">While the police launch their investigation, Hayao and his loyal dog, Alpina, set out to uncover the truth behind Tesla's disappearance.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">As Hayao and Alpina, you\u2019ll encounter an eclectic cast of intriguing characters\u2014and perhaps make a few enemies along the way!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2016820/extras/46f0bbad651d5edeaa9fbeaa3c3f6fe2.avif?t=1741698655\" /></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><div 